<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55383" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάτᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stretching</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τῶν χορδῶν
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάστασις</span> codd.)
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				803a37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> esp. for the
			purpose of setting broken or dislocated bones, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				13
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				38
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>torture, torment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				276
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατάσεις τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.599
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>violent exertion</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετὰ φιλονικίας
				καὶ κ.</span>, cj. for -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσεως</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				796a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>extension</i> in space, <i>spreading</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				58e
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στασιν</span> cod.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκὴ εἰς τοὺς κάτω
				τόπους</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.461
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
